WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.302
Survey data often arrives in long form with one row
per respondent-question If

00:00:06.328 --> 00:00:10.473
there is at most one score for each respondent and
question MAX can be used

00:00:10.499 --> 00:00:16.242
as a convenient aggregate to place that value into
the correct column The output

00:00:16.268 --> 00:00:22.148
grain becomes one respondent The Q1 Q2 and Q3

00:00:22.174 --> 00:00:23.740
categories become columns
